  "dbt3wNote": "DBT3W: analyzers, analyzers-dbt, lineage-core and project-contracts packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from green Common main 2622064 (the REPIN5 pin); semantic-core and analysis-protocol are byte-identical there. host-node and compat-v3 keep their earlier pins.",
  "caproute1bNote": "CAPROUTE1b: tool-catalog and capability-router packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from Common 6b87493 (!138); semantic-core alpha.4 is byte-identical there and keeps its pin.",
  "navsvc1Note": "NAVSVC1: view-spi pinned to Common main 55c4412a (!157 merged; re-pack from 55c4412a gives the same sha256 as the earlier 46563fb pack); arch-catalog, arch-decisions and decision-rationale packed in the same run, their sources are identical to Common main 5794003. lineage-core alpha.1 and semantic-core alpha.4 keep their pins.",
  "tbx1cNote": "TBX1c: tool-catalog 0.1.0-alpha.2 (typed sideEffectKinds, Workspace Monitoring, owns TOOL_SIDE_EFFECTS) and capability-router re-packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from Common main 5794003 (supersedes the CAPROUTE1b 6b87493 pins; both from one Common commit, byte-identical to the dd950b2 pack)."
